node_modules/
out/
out-tsc/
*.vsix
# The root .gitignore drops every `.vscode/` as editor cruft. Here it is the
# F5 launch config, which is part of the extension's source and is tracked in
# the sibling repos too. The directory has to be un-ignored before its
# contents can be: git will not look inside an excluded directory.
!.vscode/
!.vscode/*
# Copied from the repo root at package time. There is one licence and one
# changelog, both under version control at the root; a second copy here would
# only be a second thing to forget.
LICENSE
CHANGELOG.md
